1
00:00:09,277 --> 00:00:11,927
=The Glory Fades 2=

2
00:00:11,927 --> 00:00:13,798
=Episode 12=

3
00:00:14,152 --> 00:00:15,152
Sorry,

4
00:00:15,152 --> 00:00:17,911
the number you dialed
is currently unavailable.

5
00:00:59,312 --> 00:01:01,992
So you never went to
Jiasheng's Room 999 after all, did you?

6
00:01:04,032 --> 00:01:05,471
Good thing you didn't.

7
00:01:07,632 --> 00:01:08,992
All those higher-ups,

8
00:01:10,511 --> 00:01:12,672
every one of them has dirty secrets.

9
00:01:12,952 --> 00:01:14,552
You used those secrets to climb up,

10
00:01:14,552 --> 00:01:15,752
but did you ever think

11
00:01:16,671 --> 00:01:19,431
that one day, those very secrets
might drag you down too?

12
00:01:20,912 --> 00:01:22,591
For people like us on the ground,

13
00:01:23,151 --> 00:01:25,072
a fall just hurts for a bit.

14
00:01:26,712 --> 00:01:30,151
But if those high and mighty
get stained with mud,

15
00:01:31,632 --> 00:01:34,552
they'll fall straight
to the deepest abyss.

16
00:01:36,671 --> 00:01:37,671
Too late.

17
00:01:39,352 --> 00:01:40,591
I've already moved them.

18
00:01:45,752 --> 00:01:46,752
Lu,

19
00:01:48,151 --> 00:01:50,151
who the heck do you think you are?

20
00:01:51,951 --> 00:01:53,192
You're a wanted criminal,

21
00:01:53,472 --> 00:01:55,231
and Tu Jiasheng is a convict.

22
00:01:55,752 --> 00:01:58,391
You think you two can touch me?

23
00:01:59,352 --> 00:02:01,311
With a snap of my fingers, I could...

24
00:02:01,311 --> 00:02:03,391
You know better than anyone

25
00:02:04,231 --> 00:02:05,671
how brutal the race for speaker is.

26
00:02:06,192 --> 00:02:07,752
Why don't you think about

27
00:02:08,311 --> 00:02:10,752
whether your rivals would be like me,

28
00:02:11,511 --> 00:02:14,591
still looking out for you
at a time like this?

29
00:02:24,472 --> 00:02:25,472
Lu,

30
00:02:28,032 --> 00:02:29,432
you and Manni

31
00:02:30,152 --> 00:02:31,951
leaving together is actually nice.

32
00:02:32,072 --> 00:02:33,391
I'm happy for you.

33
00:02:34,951 --> 00:02:37,991
But I won't cancel the warrant.

34
00:02:38,752 --> 00:02:39,991
I'll tell the guards

35
00:02:40,752 --> 00:02:42,551
to give you enough time
to leave the country.

36
00:02:43,231 --> 00:02:44,231
Once you're out,

37
00:02:45,352 --> 00:02:47,032
don't ever come back to see me.

38
00:02:55,192 --> 00:02:56,991
Then I'll hold onto

39
00:02:58,271 --> 00:02:59,472
the evidence forever.

40
00:03:00,271 --> 00:03:01,872
If anything ever happens

41
00:03:02,072 --> 00:03:03,391
to Manni and me,

42
00:03:04,072 --> 00:03:06,551
natural disaster or foul play,

43
00:03:06,592 --> 00:03:07,951
earthquake or tsunami,

44
00:03:09,111 --> 00:03:11,192
the moment we feel unsafe,

45
00:03:12,152 --> 00:03:14,791
I'll make everything public.

46
00:03:19,391 --> 00:03:20,791
Then I wish you both

47
00:03:22,951 --> 00:03:23,951
a safe journey.

48
00:03:25,592 --> 00:03:26,991
And I hope you get what you want.

49
00:03:30,711 --> 00:03:33,192
By the way, high and mighty,

50
00:03:34,632 --> 00:03:35,991
walk the high road

51
00:03:38,592 --> 00:03:39,592
all on your own.

52
00:03:53,192 --> 00:03:56,231
Look at you.
What's with all the long faces?

53
00:03:58,391 --> 00:04:01,231
Smile. Everyone, smile.

54
00:04:03,432 --> 00:04:05,671
Know how to smile? Smile.

55
00:04:06,671 --> 00:04:08,231
See how pretty you look?

56
00:04:09,831 --> 00:04:12,791
Now that you're here,
accept your fate. Got it?

57
00:04:13,312 --> 00:04:15,951
You're lucky to work under Feng.

58
00:04:16,312 --> 00:04:17,391
Watch and learn.

59
00:04:17,831 --> 00:04:19,551
What are you slacking off for?

60
00:04:26,471 --> 00:04:29,072
Feng said we have no time
to drag this out.

61
00:04:29,471 --> 00:04:30,792
Keep the virgins here.

62
00:04:31,072 --> 00:04:33,792
Send the rest out to entertain guests
and learn on the job.

63
00:04:33,992 --> 00:04:34,992
Understood.

64
00:04:35,432 --> 00:04:37,432
- I want to go home!
- I want to go home!

65
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:09,616
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

66
00:05:09,986 --> 00:05:13,971
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

67
00:05:18,727 --> 00:05:22,046
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

68
00:05:22,046 --> 00:05:27,131
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

69
00:05:30,720 --> 00:05:37,272
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

70
00:05:37,272 --> 00:05:45,693
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

71
00:05:45,693 --> 00:05:48,922
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

72
00:05:48,922 --> 00:05:52,117
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

73
00:05:52,117 --> 00:05:54,810
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

74
00:05:54,810 --> 00:05:59,329
(Prosperity)

75
00:06:04,391 --> 00:06:05,391
Mr. Zhao.

76
00:06:05,672 --> 00:06:08,752
Mr. Nie, what's with the warrant on Lu?

77
00:06:10,271 --> 00:06:13,872
Mr. Zhao, you know
what Lu's temper is like.

78
00:06:14,112 --> 00:06:15,391
He caused such a huge mess

79
00:06:15,591 --> 00:06:17,351
and ran off with his woman,

80
00:06:17,432 --> 00:06:19,351
leaving me to clean it all up.

81
00:06:19,831 --> 00:06:20,872
Cut to the chase.

82
00:06:20,951 --> 00:06:22,951
Just tell me. What do you want?

83
00:06:22,951 --> 00:06:23,951
Votes.

84
00:06:24,552 --> 00:06:27,792
Get me the votes
from the Tianbei districts,

85
00:06:28,552 --> 00:06:30,552
and I promise I'll clear Lu's name.

86
00:06:30,552 --> 00:06:31,552
Leave Lu alone.

87
00:06:31,591 --> 00:06:33,792
I'll get you the votes.

88
00:06:34,351 --> 00:06:35,391
Don't worry, Mr. Zhao.

89
00:06:35,752 --> 00:06:37,031
To me,

90
00:06:37,351 --> 00:06:39,151
Lu is like my own brother.

91
00:06:48,351 --> 00:06:50,192
When are you going to make your move?

92
00:06:50,232 --> 00:06:51,872
Mr. Nie, I'm setting it up.

93
00:06:51,872 --> 00:06:53,872
Hurry up. I don't like waiting.

94
00:06:57,872 --> 00:06:58,872
Have you decided?

95
00:07:00,992 --> 00:07:01,992
Let me

96
00:07:02,951 --> 00:07:04,951
- think about it.
- What's there to think about?

97
00:07:05,752 --> 00:07:06,992
Aren't you avenging your boss?

98
00:07:09,072 --> 00:07:10,072
I know,

99
00:07:11,271 --> 00:07:13,192
Tu Jiasheng beat the fear into you.

100
00:07:13,672 --> 00:07:14,951
But this time it's Xia Yuyan,

101
00:07:14,951 --> 00:07:16,232
just a woman.

102
00:07:17,351 --> 00:07:18,792
Besides, once it's done,

103
00:07:19,471 --> 00:07:21,192
we can pin it on Tu Jiasheng.

104
00:07:21,831 --> 00:07:22,951
Two birds with one stone.

105
00:07:28,072 --> 00:07:30,951
Can the Nie family really back you up?

106
00:07:32,511 --> 00:07:33,511
Of course.

107
00:07:34,471 --> 00:07:35,792
Once I become warden,

108
00:07:36,351 --> 00:07:39,312
the cigarette and booze trade is yours.

109
00:07:48,112 --> 00:07:49,112
I'm in.

110
00:07:51,792 --> 00:07:52,792
Tough spot.

111
00:07:53,112 --> 00:07:56,351
You sacrificed three groups
to save that dragon.

112
00:07:56,711 --> 00:07:57,711
Is it worth it?

113
00:07:58,151 --> 00:08:01,151
Sometimes, you have to know
when to let go.

114
00:08:03,471 --> 00:08:05,031
Yet in this life,

115
00:08:05,072 --> 00:08:06,911
some things can't be let go.

116
00:08:07,471 --> 00:08:08,992
Just like this game.

117
00:08:09,511 --> 00:08:10,992
Are you the player

118
00:08:11,432 --> 00:08:12,992
or a pawn in someone's hand?

119
00:08:14,031 --> 00:08:15,271
Nobody can say for sure.

120
00:08:15,351 --> 00:08:17,192
Who can stay out of it forever?

121
00:08:17,432 --> 00:08:18,792
And who isn't a pawn?

122
00:08:19,031 --> 00:08:20,072
All I can do

123
00:08:20,632 --> 00:08:23,351
is play my own game
with everything I've got.

124
00:08:24,911 --> 00:08:26,792
Captain Xia! Captain Xia!

125
00:08:29,072 --> 00:08:30,072
What is it?

126
00:08:30,112 --> 00:08:31,351
There's trouble at Warehouse 3.

127
00:08:31,471 --> 00:08:33,951
Inmate 3125 got a piece
of broken glass from somewhere

128
00:08:33,951 --> 00:08:35,031
and is threatening suicide.

129
00:08:36,432 --> 00:08:37,432
I'll go check it out.

130
00:08:38,591 --> 00:08:39,591
Let's go.

131
00:08:43,312 --> 00:08:44,831
Never a dull moment.

132
00:08:47,871 --> 00:08:48,871
Jia Long.

133
00:08:52,672 --> 00:08:54,231
This isn't the way to Warehouse 3.

134
00:08:54,471 --> 00:08:55,631
Warehouse 3?

135
00:08:55,912 --> 00:08:57,591
Who said we're going there?

136
00:09:25,672 --> 00:09:26,672
Wait.

137
00:09:28,792 --> 00:09:29,792
Xia Yuyan,

138
00:09:30,831 --> 00:09:32,231
your day has finally come.

139
00:09:32,471 --> 00:09:33,831
How dare you!

140
00:09:34,432 --> 00:09:35,792
You dare ambush me?

141
00:09:38,111 --> 00:09:39,152
Let me tell you,

142
00:09:39,672 --> 00:09:41,072
I've put up with you for too long.

143
00:09:41,152 --> 00:09:43,152
You've fought me
since day one at Sea Breeze.

144
00:09:43,152 --> 00:09:44,751
Sour face every day.
Who do you think you are?

145
00:09:44,751 --> 00:09:45,751
What do you want?

146
00:09:48,312 --> 00:09:49,591
Send you to your grave.

147
00:09:49,912 --> 00:09:51,351
Don't you know who I am?

148
00:09:52,672 --> 00:09:54,831
I don't care who you are.

149
00:09:54,831 --> 00:09:56,392
Tu Jiasheng killed you.

150
00:09:58,991 --> 00:10:00,351
Aren't these all witnesses?

151
00:10:00,351 --> 00:10:02,231
Yeah, we all saw it.

152
00:10:02,312 --> 00:10:03,951
Tu Jiasheng killed you.

153
00:10:03,951 --> 00:10:05,672
Where's the evidence? And the motive?

154
00:10:05,672 --> 00:10:06,672
Who would believe you?

155
00:10:06,672 --> 00:10:07,991
This is Sea Breeze.

156
00:10:08,351 --> 00:10:10,231
A death here doesn't need evidence.

157
00:10:30,544 --> 00:10:34,160
♪Streetlights stretch shadows long♪

158
00:10:34,530 --> 00:10:38,515
♪As crowds fade,
who lingers on the edge♪

159
00:10:43,271 --> 00:10:46,590
♪Guarding all those unfinished lies♪

160
00:10:46,590 --> 00:10:51,675
♪Wind sweeps through the empty harbor♪

161
00:10:55,264 --> 00:11:01,816
♪Time quietly strips away the madness♪

162
00:11:01,816 --> 00:11:10,237
♪Plunging all passion
into freezing cold♪

163
00:11:10,237 --> 00:11:13,466
♪The feast ends, leaving only emptiness♪

164
00:11:13,466 --> 00:11:16,661
♪The past drifts far away, unstoppable♪

165
00:11:16,661 --> 00:11:19,354
♪If regret is an inescapable wandering♪

166
00:11:19,354 --> 00:11:23,971
♪I swallow the silence, burning alone♪

167
00:11:27,882 --> 00:11:30,371
♪Burning alone♪

168
00:11:35,877 --> 00:11:42,246
♪The glory fades♪
